# Architecture rules. Copy to `.ripplereview.rules` in the repository you review.
#
# One directive: `deny <from-glob> -> <to-glob>`. An edge in the dependency graph that
# matches both sides is reported as a violation, and flagged separately when the change
# under review is what created it.
#
# Globs: `**` crosses directory separators, `*` does not, `?` is one character.
# A malformed line is an error, not a skip — a rule silently ignored is a rule its author
# believes is protecting them.

# The domain layer must not reach into infrastructure.
deny src/domain/** -> src/infrastructure/**

# Controllers talk to services, never to repositories directly.
deny src/**/*.controller.ts -> src/**/*.repository.ts
